Z||000011||Fformula88||08-31-2001||08:20 PM||||Maybe back in the day the Fiero was faster than their naturally asperated Mk1 MR2, but now I am not sure.  Remember the Fiero is still burdened by the full weight of its composit body where as a fairly large share of MR2's I see have shed a great deal of their bodies by rusting them off.  Maybe its like molting  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  Anyway, they must be at least 200 lbs lighter now!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
